    [CI][MRV2] Add DeepSeek V4 Flash PD nightly case (#16836)
    
    ## What this PR does
    
    Adds the DeepSeek V4 Flash MRV2 disaggregated-prefill Nightly case.
    
    This branch was rebuilt cleanly on vLLM Ascend main
    `0a52fdd60d1686f34d7c942ff2ec8ae32b746359`. The previous conflict-heavy
    history is preserved in `pgzddxx:ryk/backup-pr16836-20260930-2d00dee`.
    
    ## Scope
    
    - Add the A3 dual-node selector `DeepSeek-V4-flash-w8a8-PD-prefix-MRV2`.
    - Add the two-node MRV2 PD topology:
      - Prefill: DP4 / CP4 / 16 NPUs
      - Decode: DP16 / 16 NPUs
      - Mooncake Hybrid Connector
      - DSpark speculative decoding
      - `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8` on both P and D
    - Omit `--model-loader-extra-config` on both P and D. The same four-line
    removal was validated by the performance-only carrier #17795.
    - Explicitly select `dp_load_balancing: external` in the migrated YAML
    to preserve external-DP routing.
    - Add the Nightly test sequence:
      - GPQA accuracy
      - 16K warmup
      - 16K formal performance
      - 128K warmup
      - 128K formal performance
    - Increase the external-DP test timeout from 3600s to 5400s for the
    long-context case.
    
    No runtime implementation code is changed.
    
    The single-node colocated case was split into #17796 and has now been
    merged. The temporary performance-only PD validation carrier is #17795.
    
    ## Validation
    
